1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,184
A careful point.

2
00:00:01,184 --> 00:00:03,489
Carbon will not reduce a sulphide.

3
00:00:03,489 --> 00:00:08,216
Every sulphide ore is first roasted to the oxide, and then reduced.

4
00:00:08,216 --> 00:00:14,218
Copper only looks like an exception, because there the reducing agent is the ore's own sulphide.

